  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sindhu Preman vs The District Collector, Ernakulam on 12 April, 2024 Author: P Gopinath Bench: P Gopinath Wp(C) No. 15860 Of 2016 1 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice Gopinath P. Friday, The 12Th Day Of April 2024 / 23Rd Chaithra, 1946 Wp(C) No. 15860 Of 2016 Petitioner/S: Sindhu Preman Aged 44 Years W/O. Preman, M/S. Mahima Exporters, Chalissery, Neriamangalam P.O., Kothamangalam, Ernakulam District. By Advs. Sri.N.K.Karnis Sri.Latheesh Sebastian Respondents: 1 The District Collector, Civil Station, Kakkanad, Ernakulam-682030. 2 The Deputy Tahsildar Revenue Recovery, Kothamangalam Taluk, Kothamangalam, Ernakulam District. 3 The Village Officer Neriamangalam Village, Neriamangalam, Kothamangalam Taluk, Ernakulam District. 4 The General Manager District Industries Centre, Kakkanad, Ernakulam District. Sri. Binoy Davis-Gp This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Come Up For Admission On 12.04.2024, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The FOLLOWING: WP(C) NO. 15860 OF 2016 2 Sindhu Preman vs The District Collector, Ernakulam on 12 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/101658728/ 1 JUDGMENT Dated this the 12th day of April, 2024 This writ petition was filed in the year 2016 seeking the following reliefs: \"i) Call for the records relating to Exts.P1 to P7 from the respondents; ii) Quash Exts.P5 and P6 revenue recovery notices by a writ of certiorai or any other writ, order or direction; iii) Issue a writ of mandamus or any other writ, order or direction to the 4th respondent to regularize the margin money loan and grant installment facility to clear the loan arrears: iv) Such other relief's which is deemed to be fit and proper to this honourable court in the facts and circumstances of the case.\" 2.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": ""
  },
